	(descr "PLACEHOLDER footprint for Maxim/Analog Devices MAX17048G+T10 fuel gauge IC, 8-pin TDFN-EP, package code T822+3, outline drawing 21-0168, recommended land pattern 90-0065. Body size (2.0x2.0mm), pin count (8+EP), and pin arrangement (4 pins along the bottom edge = pins 1-4 CTG/CELL/VDD/GND left-to-right, 4 pins along the top edge = pins 8-5 SDA/SCL/QSTRT/ALRT left-to-right, EP centered) are REAL/confirmed from the Maxim datasheet 19-6171 Rev 2 (8/12) page 1 ('2mm x 2mm, 8-pin TDFN package') and page 6 Pin/Bump Configurations diagram. Individual terminal pad size (0.25x0.45mm) and exposed-pad size (1.4x1.2mm) are industry-typical ESTIMATES for a TDFN-8 2x2mm 0.5mm-pitch part, NOT taken from Maxim's own proprietary package-outline PDF (21-0168) or land-pattern PDF (90-0065) -- both were located at analog.com/media/en/package-pcb-resources/ but repeatedly timed out on fetch (5+ attempts) and could not be read. Verify against those two documents (or Maxim's own KiCad/Ultra Librarian footprint if available) before fabrication.")
